<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Unibanco says buys London broker.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Unibanco says buys London broker.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unibanco, Brazil's third-largest private bank, said it has signed an agreement to buy all issued share capital of London-based brokerage Stephen Rose &amp; Partners Ltd.</p>
<p>It did not give a purchase price.</p>
<p>Stephen Rose &quot;holds as clients most of the European institutional investors who are seriously interested in Latin America and, more specifically, in Brazil,&quot; Unibanco said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
